  "decision_summary": "Multiple structurally related compounds demonstrate direct in vivo brain uptake, PET accumulation, or high brain:blood ratios after systemic administration, supporting meaningful CNS access. The only negative records are confounded by a provenance conflict and are outweighed by direct positive CNS exposure evidence.",
